#==============================================================================#
# This file specifies intentionally untracked files that git should ignore.
#==============================================================================#

#==============================================================================#
# iCloud Drive conflict copies. When the repo lives under an iCloud-synced
# folder (e.g. ~/Desktop), iCloud creates duplicate files like "name 2.sql"
# whenever a file is edited in two places. These must never be committed or
# they pollute the query corpus (the experiment globs *.sql). Best fix is to
# move the repo OFF ~/Desktop / disable iCloud Desktop sync; this is a guard.
#==============================================================================#
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*

#==============================================================================#
# File extensions to be ignored anywhere in the tree.
#==============================================================================#

# outer join data
/*_db
rstk_data/*
outerjoin_test/*/*.txt

# Temp files created by most text editors.
*~
# Merge files created by git.
*.orig
# Java bytecode
*.class
# Byte compiled python modules.
*.pyc
# vim swap files
.*.sw?
.sw?
#OS X specific files.
.DS_store
# Core files
#core

# Runtime and experiment logs.
*.log

#==============================================================================#
# Explicit files to ignore (only matches one).
#==============================================================================#
# Various tag programs
/tags
/TAGS
/GPATH
/GRTAGS
/GSYMS
/GTAGS
.gitusers
autom4te.cache
cscope.files
cscope.out
autoconf/aclocal.m4
autoconf/autom4te.cache
/compile_commands.json
/.wasm

#==============================================================================#
# Directories to ignore (do not add trailing '/'s, they skip symlinks).
#==============================================================================#
# External projects that are tracked independently.
projects/*
!projects/*.*
!projects/Makefile


